description:
Pull fields out of log lines with a regular expression and named groups.

```
parse("2026-11-20 14:03:22 ERROR [db] Connection lost")
-> { date: "2026-11-20", time: "14:03:22", level: "ERROR", source: "db", message: "Connection lost" }
summary(lines) -> { ERROR: 2, INFO: 3, WARN: 1 }
